WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.238
Step 3 renders the next morning.

2
00:00:02.238 --> 00:00:05.087
The setting is back,
and telemetry is clear.

3
00:00:05.087 --> 00:00:08.780
Now the queues show what they were
hiding: one user at high risk,

4
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:13.702
one emergency access sign-in, which turns
out to be the quarterly validation drill,

5
00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:17.900
and the review records it as a drill,
and one synchronization conflict.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.889
Grants and D L P alerts are clear,

7
00:00:19.889 --> 00:00:24.310
and this time clear means something,
because their sources are fresh.
